n is in Chinese. Let me use queries that combine both.\n\nLet me search multiple queries to fill the gap. Since there are no dependencies between searches, I can run them in parallel.\n\nThe target is 6, available is 1, so shortfall is 5. I need to add at least 5 more candidates (though not all searches will yield candidates).\n\nLet me issue searches:\n1. \"TypeScript 编译器演进\" - direct interest query\n2. \"TypeScript compiler evolution roadmap\" \n3. \"TypeScript 编译器性能优化\"\n\nLet me start with a batch of searches.\n\nActually, let me think about the number of searches. Budget is 12 searches. I'll run a few in parallel targeting the interest.\n\nLet me do:\n1. search_content open_web \"TypeScript 编译器演进\" relevance limit 10 target evaluation:interest:typescript\n2. search_content open_web \"TypeScript compiler evolution\" relevance limit 10 target evaluation:interest:typescript\n3. search_content open_web \"TypeScript compiler performance improvements\" relevance limit 10 target evaluation:interest:typescript\n\nThen evaluate results and possibly read candidates.\n\nLet me start.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"limit":10,"mode":"relevance","query":"TypeScript 编译器演进","sourceId":"open_web","targetInterestIds":["evaluation:interest:typescript"]},"id":"call_00_oFT45jmnyT8qdl1SvT377141","name":"search_content","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"limit":10,"mode":"relevance","query":"TypeScript compiler evolution roadmap","sourceId":"open_web","targetInterestIds":["evaluation:interest:typescript"]},"id":"call_01_0StDirm6JyQ3Jyga4nGt4638","name":"search_content","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"limit":10,"mode":"relevance","query":"TypeScript compiler performance improvements","sourceId":"open_web","targetInterestIds":["evaluation:interest:typescript"]},"id":"call_02_B37oOlzDEdihpdScMxBt6493","name":"search_content","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","responseId":"4f7e90